{"image":"images/6f1372c64b274a46be1c3ee7ee38dd96_qa_7ed0d6607c6b4a1a97ac1a8e3b953c9b.jpg","source_candidate":"positive/6f1372c64b274a46be1c3ee7ee38dd96_qa_7ed0d6607c6b4a1a97ac1a8e3b953c9b.jpg","candidate":{"image":"positive/6f1372c64b274a46be1c3ee7ee38dd96_qa_7ed0d6607c6b4a1a97ac1a8e3b953c9b.jpg","candidate_kind":"qa_recognized_question","needs_box_label":true,"sqlite":"D:\\AI\\kpai\\backend\\data\\accounts\\c92a0e4ea0244cd281d8224a72639c9d.sqlite3","image_id":"7ed0d6607c6b4a1a97ac1a8e3b953c9b","session_id":"6f1372c64b274a46be1c3ee7ee38dd96","batch_id":"qa","qa_event_id":"206ad563d79048738e5ee792aefdcb94","question":"帮我看看这个第三题第三题怎么做","answer_snippet":"题目：【练习4】第3题\n关键条件：\n1. 阴影部分是三角形 ADE。\n2. 底边 DE = 4 厘米。\n3. 三角形 ABC 的 BC 边上的高是 4 厘米（即点 A 到 BC 的垂直距离）。\n4. 干扰信息：BD=2厘米，EC=2厘米，F是AE中点（求面积时暂时用不到）。\n\n先想一想：\n1. 观察阴影三角形 ADE，它的底是哪条线段？\n2. 它的高是多少？（提示：顶点 A 到底边 DE 所在直线的距离，就是题目给出的那个高）。\n3. 试着列出三角形面积公式：底 × 高 ÷ 2。\n\n解题思路：\n阴影三角形 ADE 的底是 DE，高就是大三角形的高。\n\n步骤：\n1. 确定底：DE = 4 厘米。\n2. 确定高：h = 4 厘米。\n3. 计算：4 × 4 ÷ 2 = 8 平方厘米。\n\n结论：\n阴影面积是 8 平方厘米。\n\n下一步：\n1. 举一反三：如果底边 DE 变成 6 厘米，面积会是多少？\n2. 总结知识点：同高三角形面积与底边的关系。\n3. 按用户偏好：检查第2题的解题过程。"},"width":1920,"height":1080,"boxes":[{"bbox_px":{"x":173,"y":0,"width":1443,"height":946},"score":0.74,"source":"layout_prelabel","quality_flags":["tall_block","near_full_page","page:bright_page"],"annotation_status":"approved","review_note":"smoke_fixture_only_not_product_ground_truth"},{"bbox_px":{"x":475,"y":949,"width":1137,"height":26},"score":0.5011,"source":"layout_prelabel","quality_flags":["short_block","page:bright_page"],"annotation_status":"approved","review_note":"smoke_fixture_only_not_product_ground_truth"}],"metadata":{"page_rect_processing":{"x":126,"y":0,"width":1052,"height":711,"source":"bright_page"},"processing_scale":0.7291666666666666,"line_box_count":70,"draft_box_count":2,"quarantine_reasons":[]},"annotation_status":"approved","review_note":"smoke_fixture_only_not_product_ground_truth"}
